comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","login":"bartonfang","object_id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","name":"BartonFang","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/de/dc/99d2e56dcedde1f13b59cd88078a93c0805bb16fb62f022920d793e09307dcba.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/bartonfang"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":233,"end_new_line":233,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":166855021,"discussion_id":"f1e42a08ad18764cd7abe9885360378e5953eab1","body":"<div style='font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2;'><div style='font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;'>变量名拼写错误: 在第286行中，变量名'reslut_f'同样存在拼写错误，应为'result_f'。这个错误与第232行的错误相同，表明这是一个重复出现的拼写问题。在SimtComputeNoSort函数中，这个拼写错误会影响代码的清晰度。</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>问题类型</strong>: 变量名拼写错误</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>文件路径</strong>: <code style='font-size: 11px;'>moe/3rd/moe_inplace_index_add/op_kernel/arch35/moe_inplace_index_add_simt_sort.h</code></div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>行号</strong>: 286</div><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>问题代码</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto;'>reslut_f += (static_cast<float>(updatesAddr[srcOffset]));</pre><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>修改建议</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f0f8ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-radius: 2px;'>将变量名'reslut_f'统一修改为'result_f'，确保整个代码文件中变量命名的一致性。</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-03-30T16:19:55+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T20:53:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","login":"bartonfang","object_id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","name":"BartonFang","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/de/dc/99d2e56dcedde1f13b59cd88078a93c0805bb16fb62f022920d793e09307dcba.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/bartonfang"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":286,"end_new_line":286,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":166855045,"discussion_id":"93165ac8855672290f17cac69061aa08944760fb","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复混合专家（MoE）算子中，针对bfloat16和half（float16）数据类型进行原位索引加法（inplace index add）操作时，可能存在的精度损失问题。当不启用alpha缩放因子时，原有的加法运算直接在低精度数据类型上进行累加，可能导致精度不足。本次修改旨在通过使用更高精度的中间计算来提升计算结果的准确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在算子核心计算函数 `SimtCompute` 和 `SimtComputeNoSort` 中，针对不启用alpha缩放因子的代码路径进行了增强。通过编译时类型检查（`if constexpr`），当输入数据类型为 `bfloat16_t` 或 `half` 时，将输入值转换为 `float` 类型进行累加，并将中间结果存储在 `float` 类型的变量中。对于其他数据类型，则保持原有的累加逻辑不变。这确保了低精度浮点数在累加过程中使用更高精度的中间表示，从而减少精度损失，最终结果在原子加操作前再转换回目标数据类型。","created_at":"2026-03-30T16:20:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T16:20:04+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166855570,"discussion_id":"8b7f0ec22359660f6ca48cf74cce90641d43c113","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-30T16:22:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T16:22:50+08:00","user":{"id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","login":"bartonfang","object_id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","name":"BartonFang","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/de/dc/99d2e56dcedde1f13b59cd88078a93c0805bb16fb62f022920d793e09307dcba.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/bartonfang"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166855830,"discussion_id":"dd07c57f2c59b5c4bb3980e58c3ef98fb2e29817","body":"流水线任务触发